; name: Fluted round column
; group: Rotary axis
; description: Eight stopped flutes round a Ø60 × 500 mm round blank held on the rotary axis (along X; zero on the axis, at the −X end where the chuck is), cut with a Ø6 ball nose: one profile along the top in a rotary repeat that turns the column evenly round. Change the diameter, length, number and depth of the flutes with the variables.
; 
